OL,3,AG20 'family photo' cancelled after
OL,4,Aprotests over presence of Russian
OL,5,Aminister
OL,6,
OL,7,FEuropean diplomats have refused to
OL,8,Fstand for an official photo with
OL,9,FRussia's Foreign Minister Sergei Lavrov
OL,10,Fat the G20 Foreign Ministers' Meeting,
OL,11,Fleading to the American hosts
OL,12,Fcancelling the planned picture.
OL,14,FTwo officials confirmed to BBC the
OL,15,Fcancellation of the "family photo"
OL,16,Fscheduled for Friday, which usually
OL,17,Finclude representatives from all
OL,18,Fnations attending.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
