OL,3,AG20 'family photo' cancelled after
OL,4,Aprotests over presence of Russian
OL,5,Aminister
OL,6,
OL,7,F"Let me say this directly to the
OL,8,FRussian Foreign Minister: We all know
OL,9,Fwho the aggressor in this war is," UK
OL,10,FForeign Secretary Ed Miliband later
OL,11,Ftold his Russian counterpart at the
OL,12,Fsummit, accusing his government of
OL,13,Fkilling innocent civilians in Ukraine.
OL,15,FThe meeting is being hosted in Atlanta
OL,16,Fby US Secretary of State Marco Rubio.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
